{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a94698727d9090bc15fd9cd55c81807ba719e5ff78c163117adb1500ae1a022d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_b:2_4_028_03_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a729a344ab5f08f6bae39caade47546aa24e855bc6d5b1ea6cdb18af1bb61e25",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_b:2_4_028_03_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4382d835c0e3bfa2a1018872a66725237a10aede6326262a49ce760969783a77",
      "text": "刚才没能接您的电话，真不好意思。\n请问有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_b:2_4_028_03_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43992bdb0036708b65895f2dee8e6dc5b14a39ae2a42879310be0bbd416da7e1",
      "text": "想向您表达\n蛋糕的谢意",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_b:2_4_028_03_09_b:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d61b329da9eb80ce16c065f8b2581f3963b58f072ae4b2e517d97507d8e4ffd9",
      "text": "今天的蛋糕\n也非常棒",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_b:2_4_028_03_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f862bb235a07e50f0c2d0b72723b35e028154a0e21413363d2be7b340367be4",
      "text": "原来是那件事啊。\n您吃得很开心的话我就放心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_b:2_4_028_03_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c71e0a3053e2c50b42eb244443e28206faf96aa94f53313bd2c1cb1426687a97",
      "text": "其实在构思那款蛋糕的设计时，\n用到了联名合作文具的记号笔。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_b:2_4_028_03_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e4de8cc4b2799fba2f68be834d622689b1c9d42ae283433a6fd94007291cb3b",
      "text": "卷绪先生和水嶋先生也一起\n画了设计案，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_b:2_4_028_03_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce1729119d9730043823d783a1749685422597786b6ef994ab550b320908eb0f",
      "text": "两位都很中意那款记号笔，说颜色都很漂亮、\n让人浮想联翩。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_b:2_4_028_03_09_b:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10e53bbda6bfed1203b3751f65b1a65757b5cf63e165a795c52a0ffc0b5cada5",
      "text": "尤其是要表现水嶋先生构想中的多彩印象，\n丰富的色彩帮了大忙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_b:2_4_028_03_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a33d9976031bfea9398f67e727e902c2e3dac31569b7c83a1577e8bbbdb6081",
      "text": "最重要的是用起来很顺手，我正考虑以个人名义\n再追加购买一些。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_b:2_4_028_03_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ff872a4823b164ec03b684d03810946e85208ec7befaee803207bf13013613b",
      "text": "哎呀……不知不觉聊得太投入了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_b:2_4_028_03_09_b:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43e0b8ccc1241856c41cc8536ee36d0d41331fd31bd7eff56eb4be965bc0d9c9",
      "text": "接下来我自己也会继续使用联名合作的文具，\n进一步去理解它的魅力。那么先失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
